  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After watching the young upper extreme heavenly eagle for days at Lang Ya blessed land, Fang Yuan leaves by Lang Ya Sect’s teleportation Gu formation for Tai Qiu. He had rewritten its memories and Hei Fan’s leftover bindings so he could hatch it from a lone egg with his own blood. The sixth earthly calamity is close and time is short; he cannot undergo tribulation in Tai Qiu, because ancient desolate beasts and plants there would form a beast tide under heaven’s will. He stays on the fringe because the center holds wild Immortal Gu and immemorial desolate beasts. Dark Limit, strengthened by dark path dao marks from a prior calamity, hides him from heaven’s will. A borrowed rank seven Immortal Gu powers a killer move that reveals a blessed land concealed in empty space, and the young eagle carries him through the entrance.",
      "chapters": [
        1183
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "char_hei_fan",
        "sys_wild_immortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The hidden land is Han Dong blessed land. Its land spirit will only acknowledge Lu Qing Ming or Su Guang, so Fang Yuan uses familiar face as Lu Qing Ming, takes ownership, and annexes the aperture into the sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1184
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "han-dong-annexation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_han_dong_blessed_land",
        "char_lu_qing_ming",
        "char_su_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Annexation moves the whole environment intact, skips calamities and tribulations, and, with the sovereign immortal body, transfers dao marks without the usual path-conflict loss.",
      "chapters": [
        1184
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "han-dong-annexation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Han Dong is absorbed he jumps forward by four calamities, and the pinkish red spirit snake land spirit survives inside the sovereign immortal aperture against ordinary Gu Immortal expectation.",
      "chapters": [
        1185
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "han-dong-annexation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_han_dong",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He then uses the immortal killer move Days Pass Like Years to slow his aperture’s rate of time, and he names Southern Border as the cultivation opportunity he still seeks for attainment and the giant dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1187
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "han-dong-annexation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_days_pass_like_years",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In parallel, Bai Ning Bing captures rank six ice soul Immortal Gu at Jade Pot Mountain by releasing her Northern Dark Ice Soul Physique aura near death.",
      "chapters": [
        1186
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "han-dong-annexation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "gu_ice_soul_immortal_gu",
        "loc_jade_pot_mountain",
        "sys_northern_dark_ice_soul_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan returns to Crazed Demon Cave with Chu Du as Liu Guan Yi. Pang Shan sends them to the third last layer to set the Crazed Demon Agreement; Not Immortal and Chu Du probe his foundation on dense dao mark ground, and he stops at twenty steps to look ordinary.",
      "chapters": [
        1188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-agreement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_pang_shan",
        "sys_crazed_demon_agreement",
        "char_not_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The agreement is completed with the Three Crazed Demon Eccentrics, including wisdom path Secret Schemer, and Not Immortal states that only eternal life is a Gu Immortal’s worthy goal. Fang Yuan then spends about a month annexing further blessed lands, and his cultivation level rises as he skips calamities and tribulations again and again.",
      "chapters": [
        1189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-agreement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_three_crazed_demon_eccentrics",
        "char_secret_schemer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yao Huang and Heavenly Lord Bai Zu set a Blood Plain martial competition while Huang Jin tribes answer a Longevity Edict against Bai Zu tribe and Chu Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        1190
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-contests",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yao_huang",
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "loc_blood_plain",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "gu_longevity_edict",
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe",
        "fac_chu_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gong Wan Ting arrives as Prince Feng Xian’s wife; Yao tribe’s Yao Yuan Ying yields the Longevity Edict to her after three offers, and she places it at Golden Dawn Hall.",
      "chapters": [
        1193
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-contests",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gong_wan_ting",
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "fac_yao_tribe",
        "char_yao_yuan_ying",
        "house_golden_dawn_hall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Blood Plain she sends Nian Er Ping Zhi, Nian Er tribe’s Sword Child, into battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-contests",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_nian_er_ping_zhi",
        "fac_nian_er_tribe",
        "sys_sword_child"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He faces rank seven Granny Yin, counters her bewitching soul with sword heart clarity, and kills her with one sword life.",
      "chapters": [
        1196
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-contests",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_granny_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan exchanges for rank seven Dragon Breath Immortal Gu from Lang Ya Sect and folds it into ancient sword dragon transformation.",
      "chapters": [
        1200
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-contests",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dragon_breath_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Blood Plain he kills Ye Lui Qun Xing as Liu Guan Yi.",
      "chapters": [
        1205
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "kill-under-disguise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After killing Ye Lui Qun Xing he annexes Qun Xing blessed land and officially advances from rank six to rank seven, after which the sovereign immortal aperture begins to produce red date immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1206
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-and-warrant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qun_xing_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He ignores the blood battle martial competition and goes to Liu tribe territory alone.",
      "chapters": [
        1207
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-and-warrant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bone Burial Field is a Liu tribe bone-path resource ground of desolate and ancient desolate beast corpses, where he kills the enslavement path Gu Immortal Liu Yong.",
      "chapters": [
        1208
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-and-warrant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_bone_burial_field",
        "char_liu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He then strips the jade light pit of its light Gu stock before leaving.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-and-warrant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chu Du publicly expels Liu Guan Yi from Chu Sect while still hoping for later secret cooperation through immortal tribulation tempering aperture and the Crazed Demon Agreement. Heavenly Lord Bai Zu and Yao Huang issue an arrest warrant; Fang Yuan treats the false identity as disposable and turns toward Southern Border. The stretch ends at chapter 1210, titled Wanted by the Entire Righteous Path.",
      "chapters": [
        1210
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-and-warrant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Blessed lands of rank seven can be annexed only by someone with grandmaster attainment in that path. At this point Fang Yuan holds five grandmaster paths: strength, blood, wisdom, star path, and transformation path, which narrows which rank seven apertures he can take as freely as rank six ones.",
      "chapters": [
        1210
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-and-warrant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_strength",
        "path_blood",
        "path_wisdom"
      ]
    }
  ],
